# Adaptive Omnitool: "+1/+1 for each artifact you control" counts only its controller's artifacts (Bot2's Mox Ruby does
# not), and "whenever equipped creature attacks" digs only for the equipped creature: Bot1 attacks first with the
# unequipped Ornithopter (no look at the library, ! Bot1.Arrange as the control for the later attack), and equip is
# sorcery speed, refused on Bot2's turn with the mana to pay. On turn 5 the equipped one attacks and the look happens.

